      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, diaku malu audi umona munemu; diaku mukanda eu muvungulule, hashishe, ya wambile ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele dî. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nakabulula mukana muanyi ne yeye wakandisha mukanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, diaku mukanda eu undi nkuha, ûhatshishe munda muebe tente. Nunku nakaudia; ne wakadi mutue nse-nse bu buitshi mukana muanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, ya kudi ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele, ubambile mei andi mbatumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua tshiena nkutuma kudi bantu badi bakula muaku ûdi kuyi mumanye ne kudi badi ne ludimi luneme, kadi ndi nkutuma kudi Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiena nkutuma kudi bantu bangi badi bakula muaku ûdi kuyi mumanye ne kudi badi ne ludimu luneme, badi bakula mei audi kuyi mumanye mua kujingulula. Bulelela, bu meme mukutume kudi ba nanku au, bakadi kukunvuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Bena Isalele kabena bakuluila; bualu bua kabena bunvua di dianyi; bualu bua bonso ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele badi ne mitu mikole bu dibue ne mitshima ya tshitshu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mona, nenkoleshe mutu webe muhite yabo bukole, ne tshitshu tshiebe netshihite tshiabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenvuishe mutu webe mukole bu dibue dia mbonga mene, muhite dibue dia mutemu bukole. Kubatshinyi nansha, kukuatshiki buowa ku mesu kuabo, bua badi diku dia bantombokedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakangambila kabidi ne, Muana wa muntu, itabusha mu mutshima webe mei anyi onso andualua kukuambila, ûnvua bimpe mu matshu ebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, ya kudi badi mu buhika, kudi bana benu ba mu tshisamba tshiebe, akula nʼabo, ubambile ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba dî edi, nansha biasuabo kunvua nansha biabengabo kunvua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumuka butumbi bua Yehowa mu muaba wakadibu, Nyuma wakanjula, ne nakuhua ku nyima kuanyi tshiona tshia kukanka kua buloba kunene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tshiakadi tshiona tshia mahuahua a bifukibue bidi ne muoyo hakatutakanau, ne tshiona tshia nkata yakadi nʼabi, biakavuisha tshiona bu tshia kukanka kua buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Nyuma wakanjula, wakaya nʼanyi; nakaya ne kanyinganyinga ne nyuma wanyi utema bikole, tshianza tshia Yehowa tshiakanema bikole hamʼbidi hanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, nakalua kudi bantu bakadi mu buhika ku Tele-abiba, bakadi bashikama ku muelelu wa musulu wa Kebâ, ne nakashikama habo mu muaba au matuku muanda mutekete ne mutshima wanyi mukuatshike buowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashika matuku au muanda mutekete, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, nakukuteka bu mudimushi kudi ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele; nunku haunvua dî mukana muanyi, ubadimushe ne dî dianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangambila muntu mubi ne, Wewe neufue bulelela, ne wewe udi uhanga kumudimusha, anyi kuena wamba dî bua kudimusha muntu mubi bua kuleleye kuenda mu nshila wandi mubi bua asungile muoyo wandi; muntu eu mubi neafue mu bubi buandi, kadi nendombe mashi andi ku tshianza tshiebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi biwadimusha muntu eu mubi, ne yeye kena ukudimuna mutshima wandi bua kulekeleye bubi buandi, anyi bua kulekeleye kuenda mu nshila wandi mubi, yeye neafue mu bubi buandi, kadi wewe neuhandishe muoyo webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bukuabo kabidi, biakudimuka muntu muakane ku buakane buandi, bienzeye bibi ne binateka tshilenduishi ku mpala kuandi, yeye neafue. Bualu bua wewe kuakamudimusha, yeye neafue mu bubi buandi, ne kabena bavuluka bienzedi biandi biakane biakenzeye; kadi nendombe mashi andi ku tshianza tshiebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi biwadimusha muntu au muakane bua kenji biandi bidi, ne bikaleye kayi wenza bibi, yeye neikale ne muoyo bualu bua wakunvua kudimusha kuebe; wewe wakuhandisha muoyo webe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshianza tshia Yehowa tshiakalua hamʼbidi hanyi mu muaba au, yeye wakangambila ne, Juka, ya biebe mu mpata, nenyikile nʼebe aku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nakajuka, nakaya mu mpata, ekumona, butumbi bua Yehowa buakadiku, bu butumbi bunakamona ku muelelu wa musulu wa Kebâ, ne nakatua mpala wanyi hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Nyuma wakabuela munda muanyi, wakangimanyika kulu; wakayikila nʼanyi, wakangambila ne, Ya, udijidile mu nsubu muebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangila, muana wa muntu, nenteke mionshi hamʼbidi hebe ne nenkusuike nʼai, bua wewe kumanyi mua kuendakana munkatshi mua bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nendamike ludimi luebe mu tshilakalaka tshiebe, bua wewe wikale bu kamama, kuyi mumanye mua kubabela; bualu bua badi diku dia bantombokedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi hangakula nʼebe, nembulule mukana muebe, ne wewe neubambile dî edi ne, Yehowa Nzambi udi wamba nunku! Wasua kunvua, unvue biandi; wasua kubenga, abenge biandi; bualu bua badi diku dia bantombokedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
